    "text": "Adolescenti pilotano EVA contro gli Angeli. Rivoluzion\u00f2 il genere mecha con profondit\u00e0 psicologica.\nBerserk (Kentaro Miura, 1989\u20132021)\nGuts, guerriero solitario, combatte demoni in un dark fantasy medievale. Opera dark fantasy per\neccellenza.\n1.4 Principali studi di animazione\nStudio\nAnno\nOpere principali\nToei Animation\n1948\nDragon Ball, One Piece, Sailor Moon\nUfotable\n2000\nDemon Slayer, Fate/Zero\nMAPPA\n2011\nAttack on Titan, Jujutsu Kaisen, Chainsaw Man\nMadhouse\n1972\nDeath Note, Hunter x Hunter\nBones\n1998\nFMA: Brotherhood, My Hero Academia\nStudio Ghibli\n1985\nSpirited Away, Princess Mononoke\nKyoto Animation\n1981\nViolet Evergarden, A Silent Voice\nWit Studio\n2012\nAoT s1-3, Spy x Family",
